            <div xml:id="d414">

                <pb facs="0501" n="389" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg389"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">123.M832/32: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morris</hi>), <hi
                        rendition="#italic">temporarily at Vladivostok, to the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Vladivostok</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-07-10T20:00:00+08:47"><hi rendition="#italic">July 10, 1919,
                                8 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 11:50 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>I arrived Vladivostok this morning and have arranged to proceed to Omsk tomorrow,
                    July 11. General Graves will accompany
                    me. Until further notice please send message through Caldwell, who will be advised of my movements.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Morris</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
